speaking of school happening today ccsd  will swear in three new board members  they were elected by parents back in  november during the election  hector mejia live at school district  headquarters to explain what's at stake  hi hector happy monday  hey there alex good morning to you and  this is happening as the school board is  trying to decide how to safely reopen  schools the vast majority of students  have not stepped into a physical  classroom  since march and the new board members  will have a say in that as early as next  week  the new board members are lisa guzman  katie williams and evelyn garcia morales  long time board members have been termed  out at tonight's meeting they'll join  board  president lola brooks who won  re-election in november  last month ccsd announced it reached a  tentative agreement with the largest  teachers union for potential  face-to-face instruction  the plan also allows flexibility  educators can choose whether or not to  return to in-person instruction  the first phase of that plan would  include only pre-k  through third grade when asked why  superintendent dr jesus jarrah said  younger students were chosen because  they are most likely to need social and  physical education  studies also show that they are least  likely to spread the virus  and the new trustees will vote on that  plan next week thursday january 14th  at least one new school board member  katie williams is an  outspoken proponent of reopening schools  she campaigned heavily on that issue and  won  her race by a wide margin and even if  the school board  votes for the agreement next week  there's still no timeline for reopening  and i talked with the superintendent  here during a press conference last  month  he told me they were looking at a number  of factors not just the coronavirus  positivity rate  as they try to decide when they can  reopen the schools  as far as tonight's ceremony it's not  open to the public but you can watch it  online  it'll be live stream starting at 5 30 pm  reporting live near saharan decatur  hector mejia  8 news now
 

